{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bourbon Risky</strong> is a retro-style boss rush action game. Armed with a shotgun -that occasionally fires lasers-, blast through anything that dares to stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can experience three of the boss battles that are ready for Bourbon Risky. Get into Bourbon Risky's deep charm in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/0d4a133afd1f3f7a8d10f41d842d627c.poster.avif?t=1762799543\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/0d4a133afd1f3f7a8d10f41d842d627c.webm?t=1762799543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/0d4a133afd1f3f7a8d10f41d842d627c.mp4?t=1762799543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use recoil to move dynamically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shotgun is so powerful that it pushes you to the other side the moment you fire. It can use recoil to go up high, or it can quickly fall in the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.poster.avif?t=1762799543\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.webm?t=1762799543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.mp4?t=1762799543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And from your shotgun... a laser blasts out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully dodge an enemy\u2019s laser attack with a dash, your shotgun charges up\u2014empowering your next shot. Unleash a devastating charged blast and take down your foes with style!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138660?t=1762799543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/ece00eb9eb4efb71e0b29a9d7f7b0931f5a01886/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762799543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/ba227cab13b3d1dd56de81d6cb7bcf705a23ad59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762799543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138660/ba227cab13b3d1dd56de81d6cb7bcf705a23ad59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762799543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bourbon Risky</strong> is a retro-style boss rush action game. Armed with a shotgun -that occasionally fires lasers-, blast through anything that dares to stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can experience three of the boss battles that are ready for Bourbon Risky. Get into Bourbon Risky's deep charm in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/